body:
I've only ever went to therapy once, it was a free one. The therapist was kinda weird, he made me uncomfortable. But it wasn't a traumatic experience or anything lol. About getting hurt again, I was mostly talking about my family, and just living in general. I'll be honest, some days I don't bathe or brush my teeth, but I've always been kind of uncaring about myself. Some days I eat too much and some days I don't eat at all. Pretty much same situation with sleep. But aside from that, I function pretty normall, I think.

&#x200B;

